.git
**/node_modules
# Build output AND its incremental state, together. A tsbuildinfo without its
# dist makes `tsc --build` report up to date and emit nothing — an image with no
# compiled packages that still builds green.
**/dist
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.tsbuild
.claude
.playwright-mcp
mc-results
